OL,5,G0232 Assignment
OL,6,     FThe Angola prison rodeo at
OL,7,     FLouisiana State Penitentiary pits
OL,8,     Finmates against bulls in front of
OL,9,     Fmembers of the public. Is it a
OL,10,     Frare chance of escapism or
OL,11,     Fexploitation?
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FMark Kopua is a tattoo artist
OL,17,     Freviving Ta Moko, the ornate
OL,18,     Ftattoos of New Zealand's Maori
OL,19,     Fculture, while helping people talk
OL,20,     Fabout their mental health.
